            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "22-3.1. Such notifications shall be immediately forwarded to the Superintendent, who shall comply with any reasonable request from the teacher for information in the possession of the Superintendent relating to the incident or the persons involved, and shall act in appropriate ways as liaison between the teacher, the police, and the courts.",
